    "unverified_targets": {
      "gemini_cli": "The extension layout is documented in the repository research file. The contextFileName field, extension commands loaded from commands/*.toml under their file name, and the rule that commands and project hooks need a trusted folder when folder trust is on match the source of the installed Gemini CLI 0.59.0, read without running it. Activation with gemini extensions link and the command run were not observed.",
      "cursor": "The repository research file documents .cursor-plugin/plugin.json for rules and commands and says rules need the .mdc form. Discovery of rules/ and commands/ inside a plugin folder, the command name a plugin command gets, the command front matter and local plugin activation are not documented in a repository file and were not observed."
